We apply the constant multiple and power rules, as follows:

$$
\begin{aligned}
f^{′}(x) &= \frac{d}{dx}(6x^{3}) \\
&= 6 \cdot \frac{d}{dx}(x^{3}) \\
&= 6 \cdot 3x^{2} \\
&= 18x^{2}
